MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Echo Show feels like a useful next addition because its compact screen and Alexa controls could complement my home viewing and security setup, provided my cameras are compatible.",
    "The Echo Dots also fit my interest in convenient home device control, although I would choose the Echo Show instead of buying several overlapping devices."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Another HD Fire TV stick offers little benefit when I already have a 4K stick and a Fire TV television; a themed remote cover does not add a function I need.",
    "The tablets offer portable viewing, but I have no current need for another screen, and the earbuds and lighting bundle do not address a need shown by my recent purchases."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in almost any Amazon device, even when it serves a different purpose.",
    "Similar streaming devices seem to be treated as natural follow-up purchases without considering that I already have their main functions covered."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "I care about what a device adds to my existing setup, especially whether it provides useful control or works with my security cameras.",
    "My recent purchases center on home viewing and cameras; that does not mean I currently want portable entertainment devices or several alternatives for the same task."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in connected home electronics but stretched it into broad Amazon-device interest and overlooked which needs my existing equipment already meets."
}
